cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the version you used, and name the
  language model that drove the agent separately.
title: "symbolic-compactification: verified symbolic reasoning for theoretical physics"
abstract: >-
  An installable agent skill in which a language model proposes equivalent
  forms of a symbolic expression and a program alone issues the verdict:
  exact ZERO residual on the declared domain, bound to input hashes in a
  receipt. It also builds reviewer-facing derivation audits.
type: software
authors:
